{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is on the verge of destruction. With a divine mission, you become humanity\u2019s last hope as Noah.<br><strong>Noah Simulator</strong> takes the player on an epic journey across 7 different ancient civilizations.<br>Build the ark, gather rare animals, complete cross-civilization quests, and race against the coming great flood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>7 Discoverable Civilizations</strong><br>Babylonians, Egyptians, Phoenicians, and more await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc18 <strong>Animal Collection System</strong><br>Catch, convince, and bring every kind of animal aboard your ark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/7d997897d723c6144beec33f8fa4561f.poster.avif?t=1767752806\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/7d997897d723c6144beec33f8fa4561f.webm?t=1767752806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/7d997897d723c6144beec33f8fa4561f.mp4?t=1767752806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef6 <strong>Shipbuilding</strong><br>Collect resources, combine parts, and raise the legendary ark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/c554f6d2c370ff64d3dcc5816502ef5b.poster.avif?t=1767752806\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/c554f6d2c370ff64d3dcc5816502ef5b.webm?t=1767752806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/c554f6d2c370ff64d3dcc5816502ef5b.mp4?t=1767752806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Quests and Diplomacy</strong><br>Each civilization reacts differently \u2014 will you gain support or make enemies?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/843f078f66e7b6b6ca53f84150b2c938.poster.avif?t=1767752806\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/843f078f66e7b6b6ca53f84150b2c938.webm?t=1767752806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/843f078f66e7b6b6ca53f84150b2c938.mp4?t=1767752806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Race Against Time</strong><br>The flood is coming. Your decisions could change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mechanics</strong><br>Fight hunger, thirst, disease, and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Open World Freedom</strong><br>Explore the map however you want. Complete quests in any order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Noachic legends, this rewritten tale offers a powerful simulation where history and mysticism blend together.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860250?t=1767752806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/29fbe9fcef6f8442373e2c814b9d7855d2bdbece/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767752806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/4a057aed0332f615502bd54662d4ccd72bd829fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767752806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_